### ✅ F4 — Static Snapshot, Never Re-Evaluates — **DONE**

**Before:** [getPerfHints()](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/client/src/lib/perfHints.ts#258-262) called once, cached in `useMemo(() => ..., [])`.
**After:** [perfHints.ts L209-228](file:///wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/client/src/lib/perfHints.ts#L209-L228) — [ensureNativeListeners()](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/client/src/lib/perfHints.ts#209-229) subscribes to:
- `navigator.connection` `change` event
- `window` `online` / `offline` events

React integration via `useSyncExternalStore`:
```typescript
export function usePerfHints(): PerfHints {
  return useSyncExternalStore(subscribeHints, getHintsSnapshot, getHintsSnapshot);
}
```
All consumers ([LiveUpdatesProvider](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/client/src/live/LiveUpdatesProvider.tsx#21-64), [QuotesProvider](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/client/src/live/QuotesProvider.tsx#97-373), `use-trades`, [usePendingOrders](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/client/src/hooks/usePendingOrders.ts#15-90), `use-account-summary`, [AuthenticatedShell](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/client/src/AuthenticatedShell.tsx#91-140)) use [usePerfHints()](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/client/src/lib/perfHints.ts#263-266) — they **reactively re-render** when conditions change.

