**Before:** `const deadline = Date.now() + 200`.
**After:** [queryPersistence.ts L152-158](file:///wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/client/src/lib/queryPersistence.ts#L152-L158):
```typescript
export function getQueryPersistHydrateTimeoutMs(): number {
