### ✅ F8 — Service Worker Doesn't Pre-Cache Route Chunks — **DONE**

**Before:** Only `index.html` + inline `<script src>` assets.
**After:** [sw.ts L10-16, L95-149, L180](file:///wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/client/src/sw.ts#L10-L16):
- Defines `CRITICAL_ROUTE_KEY_HINTS` (Dashboard, QuotesScreen, TradeScreen, ChartScreen)
