- [collectManifestAssetPaths()](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/client/src/sw.ts#100-120) recursively resolves JS + CSS + imported chunks
- [cacheCriticalRouteChunks()](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/client/src/sw.ts#136-151) pre-caches all critical route assets on [install](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/client/src/main.tsx#8-26)
- [isCacheableResponse()](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/client/src/sw.ts#38-56) validates: 200 OK, non-opaque, same-origin, valid Content-Type

```typescript
// install event
await cacheIndexAndAssets(cache);
await cacheCriticalRouteChunks(cache); // ← NEW
```

