### ✅ F12 — `staleTime: Infinity` with `retry: false` — **DONE**

**Before:** `retry: false` — failed fetches never retried.
**After (retry):** [queryClient.ts L146-150](file:///wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/client/src/lib/queryClient.ts#L146-L150):
```typescript
retry: (failureCount, error) => {
  if (shouldSkipRetry(error)) return false;
  return failureCount < tierRetryCount(getPerfHints());
},
retryDelay: (attempt) => Math.min(1000 * 2 ** attempt, 10_000),
```
- ✅ Tier-aware retry count (1 for INSTANT/FAST, 2 MODERATE, 3 CONSTRAINED/MINIMAL)
- ✅ Skips retry for 401, 403, and all 4xx errors
- ✅ Exponential backoff capped at 10s

**After (freshness while WS fallback is active):**
- ✅ Focus/reconnect revalidation enabled for fallback polling queries so users do not wait for the next poll tick after background/foreground transitions:
  - [QuotesProvider.tsx](file:///wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/client/src/live/QuotesProvider.tsx)
  - [use-account-summary.tsx](file:///wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/client/src/hooks/use-account-summary.tsx)
  - [use-trades.tsx](file:///wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/client/src/hooks/use-trades.tsx)
  - [usePendingOrders.ts](file:///wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/client/src/hooks/usePendingOrders.ts)

