## R13 Deep Dive — Admin-Configurable Performance ✅ Complete

### What's Done ✅

1. **[PerformanceSettings](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/client/src/lib/perfHints.ts#7-15) type** defined in [perfHints.ts](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/client/src/lib/perfHints.ts) with 6 admin-tunable knobs:
   - `restFallbackPollMs` (default: 500, range: 100-60K)
   - `wsPushFrequencyMs` (default: 0, range: 0-1K)
   - `quoteFlushIntervalMs` (default: 50, range: 20-5K)
   - `maxWsReconnectAttempts` (default: 30, range: 1-30)
   - [wsReconnectBaseDelayMs](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/client/src/lib/perfHints.ts#433-450) (default: 1500, range: 100-30K)
   - `prefetchStrategy` (default: "all", enum: "all" | "critical" | "none")

2. **[resolvePerformanceSettings(input)](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/client/src/lib/perfHints.ts#275-321)** safely parses, validates, and clamps any input into valid settings

3. **[use-performance-settings.ts](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/client/src/hooks/use-performance-settings.ts)** hook reads from `/api/global-settings` query (30s stale time) and resolves settings

4. **All consumers** accept [PerformanceSettings](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/client/src/lib/perfHints.ts#7-15) as parameter and apply tier multipliers on top of admin base

5. **ConfigSync** already invalidates `/api/global-settings` on `global-settings:updated` WS event → triggers [usePerformanceSettings()](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/client/src/hooks/use-performance-settings.ts#9-21) refetch → all consumers re-render with new values. **Instant propagation works.**

